        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "Note_2",
              "section_type": "Item_15"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In February 2022, NVIDIA and SoftBank announced the termination of the Share Purchase Agreement whereby NVIDIA would have acquired Arm from SoftBank. The parties agreed to terminate due to significant regulatory challenges preventing the completion of the transaction. We recorded an acquisition termination cost of $1.35 billion in fiscal year 2023 reflecting the write-off of the prepayment provided at signing.",
            "entity_name": "NVDA Arm Acquisition Termination",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "Note_2",
              "section_type": "Item_15"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In April 2020, we completed the acquisition of all outstanding shares of Mellanox for a total purchase consideration of $7.13 billion.",
            "entity_name": "NVDA Acquisition of Mellanox Technologies",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "Note_1",
              "section_type": "Item_15"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In February 2023, we completed an assessment of the useful lives of our property, plant, and equipment. Based on advances in technology and usage rate, we increased the estimated useful life of a majority of the server, storage, and network equipment from three to a range of four to five years, and assembly and test equipment from five to seven years. This change in accounting estimate became effective at the beginning of fiscal year 2024.",
            "entity_name": "NVDA FY2024 PP&E Useful Life Accounting Change",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "Note_1",
              "section_type": "Item_15",
              "update_type": "initiation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "Based on the carrying amounts of a majority of our server, storage, network, and assembly and test equipment, net in use as of the end of fiscal year 2023, it is estimated this change will increase our fiscal year 2024 operating income by $133 million as a result of the reduction in depreciation expense.",
            "entity_name": "NVDA FY2024 Operating Income Impact from PP&E Useful Life Change",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": "2023-02-24",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
